{
  "title": "Namaz e Nawafil",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "NAFILAH OF FAJR\nMethod: It is a 2-rak'at prayer, to be prayed when dawn (fajr) falls, like the Morning Prayers.\nNAFILAH OF ZUHR\nMethod: It is an 8-rak'at prayer, to be prayed from the beginning of zawal until before zuhr, like the Morning Prayers, in units of 2 rak'ats.\nNAFILAH OF ASR\nMethod: It is an 8-rak'at prayer, to be prayed before Asr, like the Morning Prayers, in units of 2 rak'ats.\nNAFILAH OF MAGHRIB\nMethod: It is a 4-rak'at prayer, to be prayed after Namaz-e-Maghrib, in units of 2 rak'ats each, like the Morning Prayers.\nNAFILAH OF ISHA\nMethod: It is a 2-rak'at prayer, to be prayed after Namaz-e-Isha, like the Morning Prayers, in sitting position."
}
